    "title": "Evergreen Vinyl is turning-tables with their Grand Opening - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Channel 6000\nwebsite\nCamas\nEvergreen Vinyl is turning-tables with their Grand Opening\nBy Ally Osborne,\n1 hours agoPORTLAND, Ore (KOIN) – Have any plans for this weekend? Well, scratch them! Evergreen Vinyl is hosting their grand opening and ribbon cutting ceremony at their new store in Camas this Saturday, October 18! Pick up some new tunes, begin your record collection, or go on the hunt for some rare vinyl – all at reasonable prices.",
